            "verseId": "1CO.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.15.25+ROM.15.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 15.25–26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now, concerning what you wrote about the money to be raised to help God's people in Judea. You must do what I told the churches in Galatia to do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every Sunday each of you must put aside some money, in proportion to what you have earned, and save it up, so that there will be no need to collect money when I come. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After I come, I shall give letters of introduction to those you have approved, and send them to take your gift to Jerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If it seems worthwhile for me to go, then they can go along with me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
