        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.4.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cor 4.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If Timothy comes your way, be sure to make him feel welcome among you, because he is working for the Lord, just as I am. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No one should look down on him, but you must help him to continue his trip in peace, so that he will come back to me; for I am expecting him back with the brothers and sisters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now, about brother Apollos. I have often encouraged him to visit you with the other believers, but he is not completely convinced",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16.12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "he is not completely convinced",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "it is not at all God's will.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " that he should go at this time. When he gets the chance, however, he will go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be alert, stand firm in the faith, be brave, be strong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do all your work in love.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
