            "verseId": "1CO.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cor 1.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You know about Stephanas and his family; they are the first Christian converts in Achaia and have given themselves to the service of God's people. I beg you, my brothers and sisters, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to follow the leadership of such people as these, and of anyone else who works and serves with them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am happy about the coming of Stephanas, Fortunatus, and Achaicus; they have made up for your absence ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and have cheered me up, just as they cheered you up. Such men as these deserve notice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
